          <p class="gone" id="ha-done"><span class="bullet">●</span> Proposed <b>"Calm it down"</b> in Cai. Nothing runs until you approve it.</p>
          <p class="spin gone" id="ha-spinner"><span id="ha-spinGlyph">✱</span> <span id="ha-spinWord">Thundering…</span> <span class="muted">(6s · ↓ 224 tokens)</span></p>
          <div class="term-input">❯ <span id="ha-termTyped"></span><span class="bcaret"></span></div>
