        <div class="notes-bar"><span class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="round">◧</span><span class="round">‹</span><span class="ttl">All iCloud<small>386 notes</small></span></div>
        <div class="notes-body">
          <p class="when">29 October 2026 at 10:43</p>
          <h4>Things I almost sent</h4>
          <ul>
            <li class="new" id="ha-newNote">As I said THREE TIMES already, the button is BLUE. Did anyone open the spec??</li>
            <li>I did read the PRD. All 3 versions of it.</li>
            <li>Per my last email, which you clearly didn't read</li>
            <li>It works on my machine. Ship my machine.</li>
            <li>As discussed in the meeting you left early from</li>
